00:00.000 --> 00:05.600
[Music]

00:05.800 --> 00:06.500
Part one.

00:07.260 --> 00:10.600
Let's open the box and go through
everything that comes with your Sponge.

00:11.220 --> 00:13.350
On the side of the box
there's a QR code.

00:13.770 --> 00:15.950
Scan it any time to pull up
the setup guide.

00:16.400 --> 00:19.350
Open the lid, and the Sponge
is sitting right on top.

00:20.340 --> 00:22.700
Your unit number is printed
inside the lid.

00:23.130 --> 00:26.400
This is the Sponge.
The ring on top is magnetic.

00:26.780 --> 00:28.850
That's the side that snaps
onto your bottle.

00:29.420 --> 00:30.620
Next, the snap ring.

00:31.020 --> 00:35.150
If your bottle has a wider base, it fits around
the Sponge so everything sits balanced.

00:35.820 --> 00:37.050
The magnetic adhesive.

00:37.900 --> 00:40.800
This goes on the bottom of your
water bottle and stays there.

00:41.270 --> 00:43.100
It's what the Sponge snaps onto.

00:44.000 --> 00:45.400
We'll attach it in part two.

00:46.050 --> 00:47.450
Your charging cable.

00:47.450 --> 00:50.700
It's USB-C, the same cable
most phones use now.

00:51.180 --> 00:52.400
And the quick setup guide.

00:52.800 --> 00:55.300
Pictures for every step,
plus a little about us.

00:56.030 --> 00:57.550
That's everything in the box.

00:58.270 --> 01:01.900
Next up, part two: attaching Sponge
to your water bottle.
